Subject: [PATCH AUTOSEL 4.19 59/60] NFS4: Only set creation opendata if O_CREAT
Date:   Wed, 26 Jun 2019 20:36:14 -0400
Message-Id: <20190627003616.20767-59-sashal@kernel.org>
X-Mailer: git-send-email 2.20.1
